# Kanban prior lessons gate

When running **pre-implementation card review** on a **feature**, **bug**, or **agent** card — or **review** on a **`commit-issue`** card — follow [kanban-markdown/SKILL.md](../skills/kanban-markdown/SKILL.md) § **Prior lessons gate** before writing **Decisions** / **Corrective Action**. Signature: `lessons-by-area-routing` — index + routing table before broad done-card grep.

## Required

1. Read **`docs/lessons-index.yaml`** for each resolved area label (grouped Signatures + artifact paths) when the index exists locally, and the matching row in [agent-triage/reference.md](../skills/agent-triage/reference.md) § **Lessons by area** — before broad done-card grep. Index paths prefer structured ``artifacts:`` sub-bullets on done cards (`parse_artifacts_line` in `scripts/resolve_prior_lessons.py`); inline `` `sig:slug` `` on lesson bullets is indexed too (Signature: `lessons-index-inline-sig-backtick`); fall back to **Governance** link heuristics when absent.
2. Optional: `python3 scripts/resolve_feature_areas.py --lessons "<Area>"` — registry `lesson_signatures` / `lesson_docs` pointers only.
3. Run `python3 scripts/resolve_prior_lessons.py` with card **`epic`**, **`## Feature Areas`** / **`## Feature Area`** labels, and optional **`## Label Paths`** prefixes. Output includes **Registry lesson pointers** when `lesson_signatures` / `lesson_docs` are set on resolved areas (Signature: `feature-areas-lesson-pointers`).
4. Read **`## Lessons captured`** on matched **`done/`** and **`archived/`** cards only when index + resolver output are still ambiguous; skim open **`commit-issue`** cards with overlapping staged paths.
5. Load area **skills & rules** from [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) § Area → skills & rules; grep **Signatures** in [agent-triage/reference.md](../skills/agent-triage/reference.md) § Failure pattern routing when symptoms match.
6. **Record** applied lessons on the card — one bullet under **Decisions** or **Corrective Action** (`**Prior lessons (YYYY-MM-DD):**` …) with links to done/archived cards / Signatures used.

**Coverage (C4):** citations feed the **Application Coverage** sub-metric — [docs/development.md](../../docs/development.md) § **Lessons Coverage Metric**; audit via `check_lessons_coverage.py` or `resolve_prior_lessons.py --audit application`. **`**Prior lessons (YYYY-MM-DD):**` block:** parser stops at the next line starting with `**` or a `##` heading — keep grouped citations on `- ` bullets without mid-block bold line breaks; cite `name-YYYY-MM-DD.md`, commit-issue `…T….md`, and `governance-drift-registry-{hash}.md` stems — Signature: `lessons-coverage-c2-c3-audit` ([testing.mdc](testing.mdc)).

## Do not

- Skip the gate because the card is small or epic-linked Context already names a parent card
- Implement before **Decisions** / **Corrective Action** when lessons change the plan
- Duplicate **Fix pattern** prose from reference tables on the card — cite **Signature** or done-card path only

